Z||000006||286SE'S||12-01-2000||11:05 AM||||Ther previous owner (or their mechanic) may have loosened the cable to solve a problem caused by a bad caliper not releasing. Check each caliper before you tighten that cable!<BR>This is the voice of experience.||||reg||1
